            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg flex justify-center mb-2">
              <img src={`${siteUrl}/api/badge/${slug}.svg?type=sandbox`} alt="Sandbox Isolation" class="h-6" />
            </div>
            <pre id="code-sandbox" class="bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-400 p-6 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-mono overflow-x-auto border border-neutral-800"><code>{`[![Sandbox Isolation](${siteUrl}/api/badge/${slug}.svg?type=sandbox)](${siteUrl}/tool/${slug} "Verified by NoLoginTools.org")`}</code></pre>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-500">
              Verifies whether compute and storage run 100% in-browser without server ingestion.
